"ai":{"upd":"2026-08-17","img":"https://the-decoder.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/openai_logo_orange.png","t":"AI安全治理再現震盪。據《金融時報》引述內部消息，OpenAI已於7月底解散負責評估災難性風險的「Preparedness」團隊，生物及網絡風險工作分拆至其他部門，多名安全職員相繼離職，內部人士形容公司瀰漫「責任與恐懼感」；聯合創辦人Brockman回應稱安全工作已更緊密融入模型開發流程。\n無獨有偶，Anthropic披露其生物武器攔截分類器自2025年5月起失效近一年，約1.33億次外判承包商對話未經過濾，公司調查稱未發現濫用。安全初創Corma另發表測試指四款前沿模型攻防嚴重失衡：植入後門成功率達85%，偵測攻擊卻僅19%。\n產業方面，語音輸入初創Wispr完成2.8億美元融資，估值達20億美元；《華盛頓郵報》分析則指AI已出現在近四成美國國會及州長選戰中，超越以色列、製造業等傳統議題，民主黨主打風險監管，共和黨側重對華競爭。","src":[["The Decoder — OpenAI dissolved the team built to catch catastrophic AI risks","https://the-decoder.com/openai-dissolved-the-team-built-to-catch-catastrophic-ai-risks-reassigning-its-work-to-other-groups/"],["The Decoder — Anthropic's bio-weapons filter was down for nearly a year, exposing 133 million requests","https://the-decoder.com/anthropics-bio-weapons-filter-was-down-for-nearly-a-year-exposing-133-million-requests/"],["The Register — Stopping a cyberattack while walking your dog - defensive AI security CEO says it's not ruff to do","https://www.theregister.com/security/2026/08/16/stopping-a-cyberattack-while-walking-your-dog-defensive-ai-security-ceo-says-its-not-ruff-to-do/5288126"],["TechCrunch — Wispr raises $280M at $2B valuation as it looks beyond dictation","https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/17/wispr-raises-280m-at-2b-valuation-as-it-looks-beyond-dictation/"],["The Decoder — AI and data centers have leapfrogged Israel, racism and crypto as US campaign topics","https://the-decoder.com/ai-and-data-centers-have-leapfrogged-israel-racism-and-crypto-as-us-campaign-topics/"]]},
"warb":{"upd":"2026-08-17","img":"https://static-cdn.toi-media.com/www/uploads/2026/07/AP26208466949396-e1785422983213.jpg","t":"美伊6月達成的60日諒解備忘錄週一屆滿，談判未有突破，雙方立場依然強硬。伊朗外交部發言人巴加伊同日宣布，已與阿曼就霍爾木茲海峽航道達成諒解，船隻將靠近伊朗水域駛入、靠阿曼一側駛出，過渡期免收費用；特朗普重申阻止伊朗擁核是華府「頭號目標」，與副總統萬斯早前稱油價優先的說法明顯不一。\n《華爾街日報》引述伊朗及阿拉伯官員報道，德黑蘭利用60日窗口期備戰而非求和：加緊生產導彈與無人機，革命衛隊向也門、伊拉克及黎巴嫩代理人派駐顧問，並向胡塞武裝提供包括沙特港口及能源設施的打擊目標清單，揚言美方若襲擊伊朗核設施，將報復鄰國能源設施。\n同日兩架自伊朗境內起飛的無人機，襲擊伊拉克庫爾德自治區總理巴爾扎尼的辦公室，無人傷亡；庫區總統巴爾扎尼早前正是美伊秘密溝通的中間人。","src":[["Times of Israel — As 60-day MOU deadline expires, Iran says it has reached a deal with Oman on Hormuz","https://www.timesofisrael.com/as-60-day-mou-deadline-expires-iran-says-it-has-reached-a-deal-with-oman-on-hormuz/"],["Times of Israel — Report: Iran has spent 60-day MOU window getting ready to 'widen the war'","https://www.timesofisrael.com/report-iran-has-spent-60-day-mou-window-getting-ready-to-widen-the-war/"],["Iran International — Iran-US ceasefire expires (liveblog)","https://www.iranintl.com/en/liveblog/202608153827"],["Al Arabiya English — Drones attack the Kurdistan Regional Government prime minister's office in Iraq","https://english.alarabiya.net/News/middle-east/2026/08/17/drones-attack-the-kurdistan-regional-government-prime-minister-s-office-in-iraq"]]},
